# ============================================================
#  Things Vercel should not upload or try to build.
# ============================================================

# The old Supabase Edge Functions. They were replaced by the
# Node server in /server, and nothing in the app calls them any
# more. They are written for DENO -- they use the Deno global
# and import straight from https://esm.sh -- so Vercel's Node
# TypeScript cannot compile them and fails the whole build:
#
#   error TS2304: Cannot find name 'Deno'.
#
# They are dead code. Excluding them here fixes the build; the
# tidier answer is to delete the folder.
app/supabase/

# The design canvas. A 2.2 MB generated file — the biggest
# thing in the repo, and not part of the website.
design-work/

# Never needed on the server
node_modules/
*.zip
